     1,
     "Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I have a problem to run gl.dist.phylo command in R after dartRverse installation. Any idea what is missing?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you.</div><div><br></div><div>Yayan</div><div><br></div><div>library(dartR.base)</div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in gl.dist.phylo(X.gl, subst.model = &quot;F81&quot;, verbose = 3) : \r\n  could not find function &quot;gl.dist.phylo&quot;</span></span></span></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
